  "$comment": [
    "CW Galaga (#187), pinned for both ports: GalagaGame / GalagaPath in",
    "ios/Sources/MorseKit/Galaga.swift and android/.../morsekit/Galaga.kt.",
    "Read by ios/Sources/MorseKitCheck/main.swift and",
    "android/app/src/test/.../morsekit/GalagaTest.kt.",
    "",
    "Every expected value below was worked out from the rules in 'derivation'",
    "by a throwaway script, not captured from either port. Do not regenerate",
    "it to make a failing test pass; change it only when a rule is meant to",
    "change."
  ],
  "derivation": {
    "rules": [
      "Enemies enter one at a time, every entryInterval seconds, each flying",
      "its entry path for entryTime seconds before settling into its",
      "formation slot. Slots fill in order, row by row from the top, left to",
      "right; even slot indexes enter from the left, odd from the right.",
      "Formation for a wave: rows = min(4, 1 + (wave + 1) div 2),",
      "columns = min(6, 3 + wave); size = rows * columns.",
      "maxDivers = min(3, 1 + (wave - 1) div 2) enemies may be off their slot",
      "(diving or returning) at once. While at least one enemy is formed and",
      "fewer than maxDivers are off their slot, the dive clock runs; every",
      "diveInterval seconds one formed enemy, chosen at random, dives for",
      "diveTime seconds. A dive that reaches the bottom costs a life, resets",
      "the combo and steps the speed down; the enemy then returns to its slot",
      "in returnTime = diveTime * returnFactor seconds and can dive again.",
      "Each timing is base * decay^(wave - 1), floored, then scaled by the",
      "difficulty: relaxed 1.35, normal 1.0, fast 0.75. waveGap is not scaled.",
      "Naming a character hits the most threatening enemy carrying it:",
      "a diver (the further down the better), then a returning one (the",
      "lower the better), then a formed one on the lowest row, then one still",
      "entering; ties go to the earlier-released enemy. With none carrying it",
      "the shot is a miss that resets the combo.",
      "A hit scores pointsPerHit, plus diveBonus when the enemy was diving,",
      "times the combo multiplier: min(maxMultiplier, 1 + (combo - 1) div",
      "comboStep) where combo counts consecutive hits including this one.",
      "Shooting the last enemy of a fully released formation clears the wave,",
      "adds waveBonus, and the next wave's entries begin after waveGap.",
      "Speed ramp: a game starts startOffset WPM under the character speed,",
      "never under minWpm; every hitsPerStep hits in total (not consecutive)",
      "it steps up 'step' WPM to the character speed; a landed dive steps it",
      "down 'step', never under the start. A wrong shot leaves it alone.",
      "Farnsworth is ignored: a single character has no gaps to stretch.",
      "Paths are in unit field coordinates, x 0..1 left to right, y 0 at the",
      "top and 1 at the bottom where the player sits. slot(row, column) =",
      "((column + 0.5) / columns, formationTop + row * rowPitch). The entry",
      "path is the cubic Bezier P0 (-0.08 or 1.08, 0.5), P1 (0.25 or 0.75,",
      "1.05), P2 (1.0 or 0.0, 0.0), P3 = slot (left-entry values first). The",
      "dive is the cubic P0 = slot, P1 (sx, sy + 0.4), P2 (1 - sx, 0.6),",
      "P3 (1 - sx, 1.0); the return is the dive run backwards."
    ],
    "pointsPerHit": 100,
    "diveBonus": 50,
    "waveBonus": 500,
    "comboStep": 3,
    "maxMultiplier": 8,
    "lives": 3,
    "minWpm": 15,
    "startOffset": 8,
    "step": 1,
    "hitsPerStep": 6,
    "noRampAtOrBelow": 15,
