  "scenario": {
    "$comment": [
      "characterWpm 33: start 25, target 33. 'lives' is raised so the landed",
      "dives do not end the game. A test drives it with a one-character pool:",
      "'hit' shoots whatever is on the field (waiting for something to be",
      "released), 'diveLands' advances time without shooting until one dive",
      "reaches the bottom, 'wrongShot' names a character nothing carries.",
      "'times' repeats the event; the expected values are read after the last",
      "repeat. 'multiplier' is what the NEXT hit would earn. Hit totals in",
      "brackets. Scores are not pinned here because which hits catch a diver",
      "depends on the clock; the tests check each hit's points against the",
      "rule instead."
    ],
